Package: aquile-reader
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-poppler-0.18, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Modern, customizable eBook reader (Ubuntu port preview)
 Aquile Reader for Ubuntu: local DRM-free EPUB/PDF/CBZ/CBR reading with
 two-column layout, annotations, and offline-first library storage.
 .
 This preview package stages the Python application, desktop entry, MIME
 associations, and documentation. Signed APT distribution is a separate
 manual release step (see scripts/build_deb.sh).
